<title>USA: CenterPoint Properties adds to portfolio.</title>
<headline>CenterPoint Properties adds to portfolio.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>CenterPoint Properties Corp said Thursday it signed agreements involving 1.2 million additional square feet of industrial space, bringing its total portfolio to more than 16.5 million square feet.</p>
<p>CenterPoint acquired a 492,000-square-foot industrial and office campus in Arlington Heights, Ill., for an undisclosed amount. The company said it will also launch two build-to-suit projects in Naperville, Ill., for General Tire and Factory Card Outlet Inc that will involve a total of more than 741,000 square feet.</p>
<p>CenterPoint, a real estate investment trust that focuses on industrial properties, has a market capitalization of more than $600 million.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787</p>
